{"ts":1778995441571,"state_hash":"0bce5fcb8c6dec11","passage":"QuestsPage","engine":"sugarcube","body_text":"What's Next\nStory Goals\nRent's coming due and I've got next to nothing. No money, no roof — I need work, fast.\n🔓 Ready\n📍 Kitchen\n🕒 Sun 07:00–10:00\n💡 Odd jobs, anyone who'll pay — start asking around.\nI'm a stranger in this house. I should find my feet — Frank, Diana, the brother.\n🔓 Ready\n📍 Home\n💡 Cross paths with everyone under this roof.\nDiana wants me at church with her. In a town this small, the first time counts.\n🔓 Ready\n📍 Kitchen\n🕒 Sun 07:00–10:00\n💡 Stay close to Diana — she'll bring it up.\nUgh, I really need a shower.\nI'm wiped. I need to rest before I can think straight.\nRyan\nRyan's out in the yard most days. Maybe I should help him.\n🎯 To advance:\n◯ Ryan trust ≥ 10 0 / 10\nJake\nJake stays in his room. Maybe if I look right, he'll notice me. Or maybe walking past at the right moment is enough.\n🎯 To advance:\n◯ Beauty ≥ 50 0 / 50\n✓ npc_jake_stage = 0 0 / 0\n📍 Home\n💡 Two ways in: keep my beauty up (Shower / Sketch in my room) and he'll eventually look up — or pass his door looking my best, and catch his eye in the moment.\n\n← Back","body_html":"<h2>What's Next</h2>        <div class=\"npc-section\">     <h3 class=\"npc-name\">Story Goals</h3>                                    <div class=\"stage-hint-card\">     <div class=\"stage-hint-flavor\">Rent's coming due and I've got next to nothing. No money, no roof — I need work, fast.</div>     <div class=\"stage-hint-goal\"><div class=\"stage-hint-goal-header stage-hint-ready\"><span class=\"stage-hint-target\">🔓</span> Ready</div><div class=\"stage-hint-where\">📍 Kitchen</div><div class=\"stage-hint-where\">🕒 Sun 07:00–10:00</div></div>            <div class=\"stage-hint-tip\">💡 Odd jobs, anyone who'll pay — start asking around.</div>        </div>                                 <div class=\"stage-hint-card\">     <div class=\"stage-hint-flavor\">I'm a stranger in this house. I should find my feet — Frank, Diana, the brother.</div>     <div class=\"stage-hint-goal\"><div class=\"stage-hint-goal-header stage-hint-ready\"><span class=\"stage-hint-target\">🔓</span> Ready</div><div class=\"stage-hint-where\">📍 Home</div></div>            <div class=\"stage-hint-tip\">💡 Cross paths with everyone under this roof.</div>        </div>                                 <div class=\"stage-hint-card\">     <div class=\"stage-hint-flavor\">Diana wants me at church with her. In a town this small, the first time counts.</div>     <div class=\"stage-hint-goal\"><div class=\"stage-hint-goal-header stage-hint-ready\"><span class=\"stage-hint-target\">🔓</span> Ready</div><div class=\"stage-hint-where\">📍 Kitchen</div><div class=\"stage-hint-where\">🕒 Sun 07:00–10:00</div></div>            <div class=\"stage-hint-tip\">💡 Stay close to Diana — she'll bring it up.</div>        </div>             <div class=\"stage-hint-card\">     <div class=\"stage-hint-flavor\">Ugh, I really need a shower.</div>   </div>             <div class=\"stage-hint-card\">     <div class=\"stage-hint-flavor\">I'm wiped. I need to rest before I can think straight.</div>   </div>     </div>                           <div class=\"npc-section\">         <h3 class=\"npc-name\">Ryan</h3>                                        <div class=\"stage-hint-card\">     <div class=\"stage-hint-flavor\">Ryan's out in the yard most days. Maybe I should help him.</div>     <div class=\"stage-hint-goal\"><div class=\"stage-hint-goal-header\"><span class=\"stage-hint-target\">🎯</span> To advance:</div><ul><li class=\"stage-hint-unmet-row\"><span class=\"stage-hint-unmet\">◯</span> Ryan trust ≥ 10 <span class=\"stage-hint-progress\">0 / 10</span></li></ul></div>        </div>         </div>                                                                                    <div class=\"npc-section\">         <h3 class=\"npc-name\">Jake</h3>                                        <div class=\"stage-hint-card\">